 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 136,
   "sec": 2,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Birsa's Ulgulan – target:** it was directed against British land-grabbing, forced labour (beth begari) and the **dikus** (outside moneylenders, traders and landlords)."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 136,
   "sec": 3,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Critical Wildlife Habitat (FRA Sec. 2(b)):** areas of national parks and sanctuaries that must be **kept inviolate** for wildlife conservation, notified after an **open process of consultation** with the affected communities."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 136,
   "sec": 3,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **FRA implementation gaps:** focus on individual titles over **CFR** rights, **Gram Sabhas bypassed**, restrictive **MFP transit permits**, and **weak MoTA capacity** to push implementation."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 136,
   "sec": 3,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **MoEF circular (3 August 2009):** no forest diversion under the Forest Conservation Act until FRA rights are settled and **Gram Sabha consent** is obtained; it had no public-importance exception."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 136,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Dharti Aaba (DAJGUA) nodal ministry:** led by the **Ministry of Tribal Affairs**, which brings together the 17 line ministries."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 136,
   "sec": 5,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **PM-JANMAN full name:** Pradhan Mantri **Janjati Adivasi Nyaya Maha Abhiyan**; gives PVTGs housing, roads, water and electricity."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 136,
   "sec": 7,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **SHRESHTA portal:** seats for meritorious **SC students** in top **private residential schools**; online CBT registration (NETS by NTA), merit list and seat allotment."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 136,
   "sec": 6,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **PM Janjatiya Vikas Mission (TRIFED):** buys **MFP at MSP**, adds value (Van Dhan) and promotes **GI tags** for tribal products."
  },
  {
   "book": 2,
   "row": 136,
   "sec": 7,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **DACE beneficiaries:** the Dr Ambedkar Centres of Excellence give **free** Civil Services coaching to **SC students** in Central Universities."
  }
 ],
